<section>
    <div class="container">
        <h2 id="howitworks">How to Upscale Your Anime Images</h2>
        <p>Enhancing your anime artwork is incredibly simple — and completely free:</p>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Upload Your Anime Images:</strong> Select anime character art, manga panels, or illustrations from your device. Supports images up to 16MP for maximum quality enhancement.</li>
            <li><strong>Choose the Best Model:</strong> Select "Plus" for most anime art or "General" for large-scale projects. Both models are specifically optimized for anime content.</li>
            <li><strong>AI Processing Magic:</strong> Our specialized anime AI models analyze your artwork and enhance every detail - from character features to background elements. Processing typically takes just seconds.</li>
            <li><strong>Download Enhanced Anime Art:</strong> Your high-resolution anime images will appear in the gallery below, ready for download in pristine quality.</li>
            <li><strong>Automatic Cleanup:</strong> Your anime images are automatically deleted after a few minutes to ensure your privacy and free up space.</li>
        </ol>

        <br>

        <h2>Anime Upscaling Results - Before vs After:</h2>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-8 col-lg-6">
                <img src="/static/assets/images/compare2.jpg"
                     alt="Anime image upscaling comparison - low resolution vs AI enhanced 4K">
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>Amazing transformation for anime artwork! Try upscaling your favorite anime images right now — it's completely free!</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-custom mt-0 rounded-sm p-1" href="#"
           onclick="window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });">
            Enhance Your Anime Art Now!
        </a>

        <br><br>

        <h2>Why Choose AI for Anime Image Enhancement?</h2>

        <h3>AI Anime Upscaling Advantages:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Preserves Anime Art Style:</strong> Our AI models understand anime aesthetics and maintain the unique visual style of your artwork</li>
            <li><strong>Enhanced Character Details:</strong> Sharpen facial features, hair details, and clothing textures while keeping the anime look authentic</li>
            <li><strong>Perfect Line Art:</strong> Maintains crisp, clean lines that are essential in anime and manga artwork</li>
            <li><strong>Color Accuracy:</strong> Preserves vibrant anime colors and gradients without oversaturation</li>
            <li><strong>Transparency Support:</strong> Perfect for anime character PNGs and stickers with transparent backgrounds</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Traditional Scaling Problems for Anime:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Pixelated Characters:</strong> Standard scaling creates blocky, pixelated anime characters</li>
            <li><strong>Blurred Line Art:</strong> Fine line work becomes muddy and undefined</li>
            <li><strong>Color Banding:</strong> Smooth anime color gradients become stepped and unnatural</li>
            <li><strong>Lost Details:</strong> Small details like hair strands and fabric textures disappear</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Perfect for All Types of Anime Content</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Anime Character Art:</strong> Portraits, full-body characters, character sheets</li>
            <li><strong>Manga Panels:</strong> Black and white or colored manga pages</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Illustrations:</strong> Original anime-style artwork and fan art</li>
            <li><strong>Anime Wallpapers:</strong> Desktop and mobile wallpapers featuring anime characters</li>
            <li><strong>Game Art:</strong> Anime-style game characters and UI elements</li>
            <li><strong>Anime Screenshots:</strong> Frames from anime series or movies</li>
            <li><strong>Chibi and Kawaii Art:</strong> Cute anime characters and mascots</li>
            <li><strong>Anime Logos and Graphics:</strong> Transparent PNGs for websites and projects</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="line-segment"></div>

        <div>
            <h2>Privacy & Copyright for Your Anime Art</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Complete Privacy:</strong> Your anime images are linked only to your session cookie - no personal data collected</li>
                <li><strong>Temporary Storage:</strong> Anime images are automatically deleted a few minutes after processing</li>
                <li><strong>Your Art, Your Rights:</strong> You retain full copyright ownership of your anime artwork - we gain no rights</li>
                <li><strong>No Usage Rights:</strong> Your anime images are used only for upscaling - never for training or other purposes</li>
                <li><strong>Secure EU Servers:</strong> All anime image processing happens on secure servers in Germany</li>
                <li><strong>No Watermarks:</strong> Your enhanced anime art is delivered completely clean without any branding</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

